OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers disappointed by flower
OL,4,Adisplay vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen-fingered residents who have made
OL,7,Faward-winning displays said they have
OL,8,Fbeen hit by a spate of vandalism.
OL,10,FChatteris in Bloom, from the
OL,11,FCambridgeshire town, said a scarecrow
OL,12,Ffirefighter and a FIFA World Cup
OL,13,Freplica had been damaged.
OL,15,FThe group, a community organisation of
OL,16,Fvolunteers, is one of four finalists in
OL,17,Fthe town category of the Royal
OL,18,FHorticultural Society's (RHS) Britain
OL,19,FIn Bloom competition, with its chosen
OL,20,Ftheme "Around the World in 80 days".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
